#. module: oudu_iot
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:oudu_iot.oudu_host_view_form_iot
msgid "Point of Sale: under Configuration › Settings › Connected Devices, enable IoT Box and enter this host's address as its IP Address to use scanners, scales and receipt printing, or enable ePos Printer and enter it as the Epson Printer IP for receipts only. No Oudu module is required for this."
msgstr "POS：在「配置」›「设置」›「连接设备」中启用「IoT 盒子」并把此主机的地址填入「IP地址」，即可使用扫码枪、电子秤和小票打印；或启用「ePOS打印机」并填入「Epson 打印机 IP地址」，仅用于小票。无需任何 Oudu 模块。"

#. module: oudu_iot
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:oudu_iot.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Point of Sale: under Configuration › Settings › Connected Devices, enable IoT Box and enter an Oudu IoT host's address as its IP Address to use scanners, scales and receipt printing, or enable ePos Printer and enter it as the Epson Printer IP for receipts only. No Oudu module is required for this."
msgstr "POS：在「配置」›「设置」›「连接设备」中启用「IoT 盒子」并把 Oudu IoT 主机的地址填入「IP地址」，即可使用扫码枪、电子秤和小票打印；或启用「ePOS打印机」并填入「Epson 打印机 IP地址」，仅用于小票。无需任何 Oudu 模块。"

#. module: oudu_iot
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:oudu_iot.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Register Oudu IoT hosts on your local network and test them from this browser."
msgstr "登记局域网内的 Oudu IoT 主机，并在此浏览器中测试连接。"

#. module: oudu_iot
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:oudu_iot.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Oudu IoT product overview"
msgstr "Oudu IoT 产品概览"

#. module: oudu_iot
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:oudu_iot.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Native Odoo ESP32 edge hardware gateway"
msgstr "原生 Odoo ESP32 边缘硬件网关"

#. module: oudu_iot
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:oudu_iot.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Connect scanners, scales, receipt printers and cameras to standard Odoo through the native IoT Box and ePOS interfaces. Devices work without this module; it adds a host list, connection tests and gateway shortcuts."
msgstr "通过原生 IoT Box 与 ePOS 接口，把扫码枪、电子秤、小票机和摄像头接入标准 Odoo。设备无需本模块即可使用；本模块提供主机清单、连接测试与网关入口。"

#. module: oudu_iot
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:oudu_iot.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid "Online flashing needs desktop Chrome, Edge or Firefox. Connection tests need Chrome or Edge."
msgstr "在线烧录需使用桌面版 Chrome、Edge 或 Firefox；连接测试需使用 Chrome 或 Edge。"

